  "label": "stereotype of physical disability as deficit",
  "description": "The meme challenges the stereotype that physical disability is inherently a deficit or something to be 'fixed' or overcome. This stereotype is deeply rooted in societal attitudes and requires background knowledge of how disability is socially constructed and how such stereotypes have historically been used to marginalize people with disabilities.",
